{"seq":3,"slug":"stackability-physical-attribute-modeling","title":"可堆叠性与物理属性建模：承重、朝向限制与易碎危品标记","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-loading-stowage-cartonization-optimization/loading-problem-packaging-data-model/stackability-physical-attribute-modeling","wordCount":3016,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"可堆叠性与物理属性建模-承重-朝向限制与易碎危品标记\">可堆叠性与物理属性建模：承重、朝向限制与易碎危品标记</h1><p>一个 22 kg 的纸箱放在三层同类箱的最下面，顶上压着 66 kg——体积上完全放得下，求解器于是把它排进装载方案。现场装柜时最下面那箱的竖楞被压溃，整垛倾斜，柜门处两箱撞在一起。问题不在装箱算法，在于这条 SKU 的属性记录里 <code>stackable</code> 字段是空的，而空值被求解器当成了&quot;可以&quot;。可堆叠性不是元数据里的一个布尔位，而是一组<strong>物理约束</strong>：能承多少、能不能倒过来放、能不能压、能不能和其他货贴在一起。本文把这组约束拆成可建模、可校验、可交给求解器的形式，与同章 <a href=\"packaging-master-data-model\">包装主数据模型</a> 衔接——后者定义&quot;可装载单元的原子&quot;，本文定义&quot;这个原子允许被怎么摆、怎么压、和谁挨着&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-物理属性是约束-不是标签\">核心概念：物理属性是约束，不是标签</h2><p>把物理属性当标签，建模就会退化成给每个 SKU 打几个布尔值，然后期望求解器自己理解它们的含义。正确的视角是：<strong>每条属性都对应一个不等式约束或一个可行域缩减</strong>，缺省值的语义必须是&quot;保守拒绝&quot;而非&quot;默认允许&quot;。装载系统里至少存在五类物理约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性类别</th>\n<th>约束形态</th>\n<th>缺省（空值）时的正确语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承重 / 可堆叠</td>\n<td>堆叠载荷上限（力的不等式）</td>\n<td>不可承压，禁止被压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>朝向限制</td>\n<td>可行旋转集合的缩减</td>\n<td>仅允许一个竖直朝向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>易碎度</td>\n<td>可承受加速度上限（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 值）</td>\n<td>按最脆弱处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>危险品性质</td>\n<td>隔离 / 分舱 / 禁止混装</td>\n<td>拒绝与其他货同柜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺寸 / 重量</td>\n<td>几何与质量的等式</td>\n<td>不可装载（数据缺失）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前两类决定&quot;本箱能不能被压 / 能不能倒放&quot;，后两类决定&quot;本箱能不能和别的货放在一起&quot;，共同构成装箱求解器的<strong>可行性判据</strong>：求解器可以不知道 ECT 是什么，但必须收到一个可判定的载荷上限和一张允许旋转矩阵。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;箱体主数据&lt;br/&gt;L×W×H + 毛重&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;承重: BCT / 顶面载荷上限&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;朝向: 允许旋转子集&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;易碎: G 值&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; E[&quot;危险品: UN 编号 / 类 / 包装组&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; F[&quot;堆叠约束: 上方总重 ≤ 载荷上限&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; G[&quot;姿态约束: 旋转矩阵缩减&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; H[&quot;隔离约束: 相邻 / 同柜判定&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; I[&quot;装箱求解器可行性判据&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[&quot;可装载方案集&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"箱体主数据&lt;br/&gt;L×W×H + 毛重\"] --&gt; B[\"承重: BCT / 顶面载荷上限\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"朝向: 允许旋转子集\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"易碎: G 值\"]\n  A --&gt; E[\"危险品: UN 编号 / 类 / 包装组\"]\n  B --&gt; F[\"堆叠约束: 上方总重 ≤ 载荷上限\"]\n  C --&gt; G[\"姿态约束: 旋转矩阵缩减\"]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; H[\"隔离约束: 相邻 / 同柜判定\"]\n  F --&gt; I[\"装箱求解器可行性判据\"]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[\"可装载方案集\"]</pre><h2 id=\"承压强度-从-bct-到可堆叠层数\">承压强度：从 BCT 到可堆叠层数</h2><p>纸箱承压能力有明确的实验定义：<strong>ISO 12048:1994</strong>（包装—压力与堆码试验）与 <strong>ASTM D642</strong>（运输容器抗压强度试验方法）规定如何在压力试验机上对整箱施加垂直载荷并记录抗压强度，ASTM D4169 则组织成运输包装的性能试验序列（来源：ISO 12048:1994；ASTM D642 / D4169）。试验得到关键量 <strong>箱体抗压强度（Box Compression Test, BCT）</strong>。无实测数据时，行业用 <strong>McKee 公式</strong>从纸板参数估算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>5.87</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BCT \\approx 5.87 \\cdot ECT \\cdot \\sqrt{Z \\cdot t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.87</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.0645em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9755em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0645em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ECT</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是纸板边压强度（Edge Crush Test），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z = 2(L+W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是箱体周长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是纸板厚度（来源：McKee 等，TAPPI / 美国林产品实验室纸箱强度模型）。该式在英制单位下标定，改公制必须重新标定系数；直接把毫米和 kN/m 代进去会得到量级错误的答案。</p>\n<p>真正决定装载方案的不是 BCT，而是<strong>允许承载上限</strong>。瓦楞纸箱持续受压数周后抗压强度可损失三分之一甚至更多，湿度 80% 以上衰减更快，因此工程上给 BCT 加安全系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>allow</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{allow}} = BCT / SF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">allow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SF \\approx 3 \\sim 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>：短周期周转用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SF \\approx 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>，长期仓储或高湿环境取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SF \\ge 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>。同一箱体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 取 3 还是 6 可堆叠层数差一倍，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SF</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>仓储条件与周转周期的业务输入</strong>。有了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>allow</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{allow}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">allow</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，同规格箱体（毛重均为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>）的最大堆叠层数可解析求出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>w</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>allow</mtext></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⟹</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>allow</mtext></msub><mi>w</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n-1)\\,w \\le P_{\\text{allow}} \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad n_{\\max} = 1 + \\left\\lfloor \\frac{P_{\\text{allow}}}{w} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span 